  "id": "baked-anchovy-stuffed-red-mullet-with-fennel",
  "name": "Baked Anchovy-Stuffed Red Mullet with Fennel",
  "subtitle": "Herb-filled fish roasted over fennel and onion",
  "description": "Red mullet are filled with an anchovy, breadcrumb, tomato, garlic, and parsley mixture, then baked with fennel and onion and served with lemon and crusty bread.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "yield": {
